            "author": "iseyara",
            "region": "GB",
            "shares": 0,
            "caption": "I love this game but it messes with my head 🥹 I always hope you can be nice and honest to NPCs and maybe trade in return for help. But no 😭😭😭💔 Apparently I was supposed to lie to her to get her to follow me to help the guy. So now the poor guy is gonna be stuck in his braindance confusion forever, all cos I couldn't lie 😭 Now I feel like lying woulda been better 😭 But it wouldn't have even been a white lie!! Just a full-on, staight-up lie and manipulation... 😭😭😭💔 I don't wanna manipulate someone 😭😭😭 I've been manipulated enough in life to know I never wanna do that willingly!! Urgh, shades of grey are not my strong suit 🤣 I am so playing the wrong game, haha (but it's so pretty and cool... even if it makes me sleepy a lot cos it's too much for my brain to absorb 😅) Anyways, fun fact: my most beloved online pseudonym starts with V, so I love it when NPCs call me V. My late gf used to call me my online name irl, and all my friends online know me as such, so I really feel a kinship with V ❤️‍🩹 I prefer my pseudonym to my real name xDD Ohhhh, as I was posting this, my sib and their hubby just gave me the money to buy Phantom Blade Zero cos they know I've been feeling so bad lately?!?! Omggggg. Uuurgh, now I wanna play that!! My family are the kindest 😭😭😭❤️‍🩹❤️‍🩹❤️‍🩹 Just bought it, whoaaa. Do O pause Cyberpunk again like I did 2 years ago??? #cyberpunk #npc #epicfail ",
